WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,360
Three people did it today

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:03,480
We can't let a dozen people all get the same meat.

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:06,000
You are directly tying labor and revenge to each other

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Then if there is a big fire, we will still recruit people.

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,040
Next step is to build the kitchen

6
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,040
Who wants to eat meat

7
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,360
Who gets the workload in exchange?

8
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:12,640
We still sleep on the floor

9
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:14,080
You are ready to build a house

10
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:25,330
So don't waste any more energy frying who's the boss mutton? It's finished.

11
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:26,680
You guys worked all afternoon

12
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,160
Just bring back these grapes

13
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:29,280
we feed ourselves

14
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:32,020
I don’t believe it’s just revenge.

15
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:36,420
Last time someone went to help Su Ce

16
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:37,860
You can also bring back venison

17
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:38,940
Why is it your turn?

18
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:39,980
Just nothing

19
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:41,260
Must be hiding

20
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:42,940
Su Ce made it clear from the beginning

21
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,380
Today's revenge is full control

22
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:45,780
Not packed for the whole camp

23
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,380
A job we are willing to take on ourselves

24
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:48,780
Just don't open your mouth and I'll give you a buckle

25
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:49,980
Hidden hat

26
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,780
What about the rest of the camp?

27
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:53,380
You didn't go to work today

28
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:54,580
Why ask them?

29
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:56,420
Not the favorite to say

30
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:57,380
Are they all sisters?

31
00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:58,460
Then take out the mask

32
00:00:58,460 --> 00:00:59,420
One per person

33
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:01,540
Why do you talk about sisters when it's someone else's turn to get meat?

34
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:02,820
It's your turn

35
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:03,860
Let’s talk about contribution
